  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="c4b00826-ccd9-5cd5-b5fb-4a862ce25d51" activityNameId="c1fe69b7-8b6e-52c6-aab7-7bd057a8b995" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Fodder beets IP, at farm</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Fodder beets IP, at farm
Inventory refers to the production of 1 kg fodder beets IP, at farm with a moisture content of 85%. Fresh matter yield/ha at 85% moisture is 97002kg.;
Synonyms: Beta vulgaris; 
UUID: 0866ff5a-8efd-3d8d-9798-947053ccf04c
The inventory includes the processes of soil cultivation, sowing, weed control, fertilisation, pest and pathogen control and harvest. Machine infrastructure and a shed for machine sheltering is included. Inputs of fertilisers, pesticides and seed as well as their transports to the farm (1km) are considered. The direct emissions on the field are also included.
Location: Refers to an average production in the Swiss lowlands.
Technology: Integrated production
Time period: The yield data have been collected for the years 1996-2003.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data were compiled from statistics, pilot network, fertilising recommendations, documents from extension services, information provided by retailers and expert knowledge. The production data were verified and adjusted by a group of experts. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_0866ff5a-8efd-3d8d-9798-947053ccf04c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
